In the use of excavators after mining in the first place, we need to promptly to maintenance and care of scoop, because the site need to contact with the material over a long period of time, because is very easy to get some water or corrosive materials and produce more damage, especially the bucket lip areas are more likely to wear, so perfect every day care, and regularly carries on the maintenance and maintenance.
In addition, if the bucket blade has become dull and the effect is reduced after long-term use, the operators also need to pay attention to the processing of the bucket blade in time. Generally, the whole bucket blade can be regrinded with a special industrial grindstone, so as to improve the working efficiency of the bucket machine.
Jining Zhongyuan construction machinery thinks that excavators do not need to frequently replace the bucket, and even if the excavator needs to replace the bucket, it is better to choose the original excavator bucket parts, because the excavator has been strictly matched before leaving the factory, and the bucket can not be replaced at will. If it’s broken and can’t be used, go to the garage to get a corresponding one.
Generally depends on the degree of wear and tear of the bucket and bucket teeth, the standard type of bucket earthwork is more wear and tear is smaller about 4-5 months to replace it is better. Rock bucket replacement bucket teeth is relatively fast.
