There are many kinds of excavator bucket, it is the key to choose the bucket, and the quality of the bucket also directly affects the efficiency and service life of the bucket, so it is very important to choose a good quality bucket, the quality of the excavator bucket should be how to judge?
1 to see the quality of the bucket, first of all to see the production process of the bucket and its accessories. The production process of the bucket includes blanking, car, milling, drilling, forming, welding, grinding, sandblasting, spraying and other processes.
Finally, to see the welding process, the bucket is welded by a lot of plates, if the welding process is not in place, it will greatly affect the quality of the bucket, affect the service life of the bucket. Therefore, when we look at the bucket, we must carefully check the welding process, in order to ensure the quality of the bucket, and then consider whether it is beautiful.
