Nitrates in the aquarium. How to determine?
The best way to avoid this situation is to use nitrate tests in a timely manner. Nitrates.
The fact is that nitrates are present even in tap water. With acceptable levels for it, usually <10 mg / l. Therefore, for 100% reliability of the test results, you must first test the tap water, then from the aquarium, and then compare the readings.
