News - How to connect the watt-hour meter correctly when the distributed photovoltaic grid is connected?
At present, photovoltaic grid-connected electricity meters are divided into three-phase electricity meters and single-phase electricity meters. When the inverter capacity of photovoltaic power station is below 5KW, the inverter is connected to the electricity meter and the single-phase electricity meter is selected.First of all, let’s walk you through the fundamentals of three-phase electricity and single-phase electricity and what the difference is.
Three-phase electric The generator that can produce the same amplitude, the same frequency and the phase difference of 120° is called the three-phase generator;
Appliances are single-phase whether they are two-legged or three-legged.
