Connection mode Fiber optic cable connection in the prefabricated cabin often adopts on-site welding, surrounding dust, temperature and humidity and other environmental factors will have an impact on its process, so after research, the emergence of optical cable connector, do not need to weld, more simple and convenient.
When connecting the equipment in the cabinet, the prefabricated cabin is pulled out from the optical cable distribution frame, and the cable connector is connected on one side of the distribution frame. Each core of the optical cable is led out through the flange head, and the equipment in the cabinet is connected through the connector.
As we have mentioned above, the cable connectors of the prefabricated cabins use aviation plugs, and there are two types of round and square common ones in the market. According to the requirements of the use of the cables in the prefabricated cabins, the round type is often chosen, which can connect the cables without occupying space and achieve 360° electromagnetic shielding.
In addition, the anti-misinsertion key is also a very effective improvement of the connector, which can prevent the installation of multiple connectors on a panel, resulting in misinsertion.
