Natural stone has high-grade texture and delicate texture, and is very popular as a finishing material for interior and exterior decoration of buildings.
Such as marble, its surface finished is very important, because designers will choose the appropriate surface treatment form according to the type and pattern, hardness and characteristics of the stone, and then present it in the interior space. It can better ensure the effect of the design works, meet the design requirements of safety, functionality and aesthetics, and avoid some design problems.
According to the applications, it can be roughly divided into the following four categories:
Polished surface refers to the surface obtained by rough grinding, fine grinding and fine grinding of the flat plate with abrasives, and polishing with polishing powder and agent. The surface is mirror-bright, brightly colored, and has few and very small pores.
The matt-treated stone often has a certain luminosity, but the reflection of light is weak. It is a flat and smooth surface, but the luminosity is low.
This process is common in marble and limestone, and has good anti-skid performance. It is mostly used in bathroom, kitchens, roads, and is often used to soften the luster of granite.
Flamed surface refers to the rough surface finish made of acetylene, oxygen as fuel or propane, oxygen as fuel, or high temperature flame generated by petroleum liquefied gas and oxygen as fuel.
The flamed surface has certain requirements on the thickness of the marble. Generally, the thickness of the stone is at least 20mm and the surface is crystallized to prevent the stone from cracking during the processing.
The surface of the stone is washed with a water jet machine, showing unevenness, but the surface is smooth without edges and corners, similar to the acid wash surface, but the surface color is close to the smooth surface, slightly darker than the acid wash surface, and the water absorption rate is small. Bush hammered finishing surface
This processing method can be divided into two types: machine-made surface (machine) and hand-made surface (handmade). Generally speaking, hand-made noodles are more dense than machine-made noodles, but they are more laborious and the price is relatively high.
The method of pineapple surface is to process the stone surface to be more uneven than the Bush hammered surface, and the graininess is more obvious. The texture of the material is just the opposite of that of the washed surface, with weaker bumps and larger graininess.
In order to avoid accidental injury, the passivation treatment of the notch should be considered in this approach, and grinding can be done if necessary.
Sandblasted finished surface The sandblasting treatment of natural stone (stone sandblasting surface) is to use angular emery, quartz sand, river sand and other abrasives to impact the stone surface under the drive of compressed air (or water), resulting in a similar glass.
The processing way can make the stone material has good anti-skid function, at the same time and do not break beautiful, so the application range is very wide, not only can be used for sheet, specification sheet plate and other natural stone products processing, can also, railings, stairs, corner line, pillars and special shape stone processing, and sandblasting processing is also widely used in stone carving, It is often seen in hotels, conference rooms, museums, corridors and other occasions.
It is believed that in the future development, as consumers know more about and use the stone, the types of stone products will only become more and more diverse.
