NPT: full name is National Pipe Thread, Belonging to the US standard 60 degree tapered pipe thread, used in North America, access GB / T12716-1991.
PT(BSPT): full name is British Standard Pipe Thread, is 55 degrees sealed cone thread, belonging to the Wyeth thread family, used in Europe and Commonwealth countries, commonly used in water and gas pipe industry, taper 1:16, access GB / T7306-2000. G thread: 55 degree non-threaded sealing pipe thread
