Ink cover uniform gloss, no fall off, scratch, dew copper, offset, hanging plate and other phenomena.
Silkscreen printing symbols and letters clear, no omissions and blur, reverse printing, offset and other undesirable phenomena.
PCB bottom plate forming, there shall be no leakage, offset, hole collapse, edge, plug hole, beer burst, beer reaction, crushing and other phenomena.
