However, there are some people has objections about it. Someone worries about that the amount of the scooters which were put in on the streets is excessive, it may will threat the transportation especially the walkers.
The UK government has neutral attitude about the electric scooters, they have permit the merchant to start the sharing mobility business and forbidden the personnel use their private scooters in the road. If someone break the rules, the riders will have a fine about 300 pounds and the driving license points will be deducted by six points.
