Among Instagram connoisseurs and curious people algorithm mysteries and codes that control what we see there are insistent comments that one of the most imminent changes is that the likes will disappear of our publications. Our followers and those who look at our post can give “ ”, But the counting of these hearts for all users will only be visible to the person making the post.
Only the owner From the publication you can know how many people have seen them. It's that number that appears in the lower left corner of your Instagram story.
For Gaby Castellanos, one of the people most influential in advertising and marketing in Spain and the world according to Fast Company magazine and the Top List 100 Women Leaders 2018, the omission of like on Instagram avoid scams and scams in social networks especially from those who pose as influencers when they are not. Sounds good, right?
Small Instagram users fear that this will come true. It would be a blow to many popular profiles and for the influencer who usually measure the engagement or commitment of their audience in addition to the number of followers, by likes they get.
The influencer could use screenshots of their post, metrics and interactions to show the link with his followers and engagement. Obviously it will be harder for brands to detect them with the naked eye by researching on Instagram.
If likes are hidden this analysis that anyone can do simply by reviewing each user's profile it will no longer be possible.
Apparently it tries discourage the "flock" mentality or the pressure of the group and that the followers are not influenced by the opinions of others when interacting on Instagram.
Could lose customers or they will have to adapt to the new perspective. In addition to adding extension to the comments, they should be relevant and meaningful.
Although there is no official statement from the Instagram team, apparently this application operation is found in test mode and could be progressively generalized to all users.
The crisis they can mean the emergence of new opportunities if you have a positive attitude and open mind to the search for alternatives. Alert influencers and micro influencers, maybe the time to reinvent.
Share with your Friends by Direct with Instagram Groups
In several articles of this blog I have touched on the topic of Hashtags or labels, assuming everyone knows what it is.
But I have thought that there may be someone who does not know very well how this matter works, so I have been investigating and I want to share this brief history of source of the hashtag, before entering into matter.
So the use of # was generalized to accompany not only keywords, but also to add comments relevant and began using the name "hash"For the symbol that was always called" numeral ".
Hashtags begin to be used shyly in Twitter, but they began to go viral when the people and communities affected by the forest fires that occurred at the end of 2007 in the North American city of San Diego, used the Hashtag “#Sandiegofires”, to report what was happening.
A year later the Trending Topics, Twitter section that shows the most popular hashtags. In fact, in the best instagram accounts, influencers do not stop using them, mentioning companies, moods, situations, objects, etc ...
The hashtag sopopular is the #TBTIt has 373.475.602 publications, yes, three hundred seventy-three million four hundred seventy-five thousand six hundred two photos shared by millions of users on Instagram.
On Instagram all Thursday, since 2012, users share old pictures of themselves and label them with the popular hashtag. Perhaps the popularity of the label has been strengthened because celebrities often use it to make fun of themselves, for its appearance infant Different and old fashioned.
Some companies use #tbt, to share photographs of the company's history and its beginnings, to strengthen the bond with its customers.
It is only used in Thursday
It has been used for a long time, but it became viral on 2012
The photos must be at least 5 years ago, to make them more realistic you can “age them”A bit applying the right filters
El hashtagmore popular, has 1.090.304.973 publications. In such a troubled world, it is comforting that it is the most used label.
It is used, since the year 2009 on Twitter, to suggest to your followers that they follow someone you consider relevant. A variation of this tag is the hashtag #FF.
I love this hashtag, which has 323.243.484 associated publications; says a lot and very little and it's fine short.
This label accompanies the creations of millions of artisans and local residents associations on Instagram, it's very inspiring and interesting to continue with your 261.130.458 publications.
Accompany publications funny, hilarious, to take into account just like other millions of users who have used it at least 235.703.529 times.
Flashbakcfriday If you have forgotten Share an old photo on Thursday, with the hashtag #tbt, don't worry, you can do it on Friday but using this other hashtag.
Of being a simple tool programming, in the beginning, the symbol numeral, precursor of the hashtag, has evolved to become not only in the way of grouping topics of interest, but in a means of communication in itself.
Tan Management which has transcended the different social networks and participates in many of them, perhaps in all of them.
The fact that the most popular hashtags are in English, far from being a barrier, constitutes a unifying element since perhaps a Chinese cannot understand Spanish, or a Hindu cannot understand Russian; but all of them could without much difficulty know the meaning of such universal words as love, family, good, food ... The hashtags us vinculanunite and near.
