The Gifs are those nice animations made with several photos that denote movement, have a duration of about 3 to 5 seconds and are repeated ad infinitum.
What differentiates a boomerang from a gif is that the transition between the beginning and the end of the sequence is not abrupt but very subtle, what they call the loop effect. It is a video sequence of about 4 seconds that repeats to infinity.
Instagram does not offer the possibility to do and upload gif, yet, so to be able share These publications must use third-party applications.
